        help
            Channels, in order: TEMP_BRAKE_FL, TEMP_BRAKE_FR, TEMP_BRAKE_BL,
            TEMP_BRAKE_BR (frame 0x500). Typically a thermocouple or IR part
            driver instead.
            Empty = not fitted (or simulated with LBR_SENSOR_SIM). Otherwise one
